{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-ccg-cosimplicial-identities","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:ccg-cosimplicial-identities","kind":"definition","title":"Cosimplicial identities for the jet/descent face and degeneracy maps","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-descent"],"tags":["cosimplicial","face","degeneracy","ascent","descent","retraction"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_cosimplicial_identities","text":"ccg-cosimplicial-identities.md","leanSource":"ccg-cosimplicial-identities.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:ccg-cosimplicial-identities\"></a><p><em>The coface maps <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\delta^i</code> (composites of jet prolongation with Čech face maps) and codegeneracy maps <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma^j</code> (composites of <a class=\"refterm\" href=\"#term-descent\">descent</a> with Čech degeneracy maps) satisfy the cosimplicial identities:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\delta^j \\circ \\delta^i = \\delta^i \\circ \\delta^{j-1} \\;(i &#x3C; j),\n  \\quad\n  \\sigma^j \\circ \\sigma^i = \\sigma^i \\circ \\sigma^{j+1} \\;(i \\leq j).</code></pre>\n<p><em>They also satisfy the mixed identities. Each case reduces either to disjoint-support commutation or to the left-inverse identity <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{d}_{n+1} \\circ \\ell_n = \\mathrm{id}</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/ccg-cosimplicial-identities.md","heading":"Definition","number":"6.10.3","page":"b/def-ccg-cosimplicial-identities","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":15,"unknown":0,"stale":38},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.ccg_cosimplicial_identities","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/ccg-cosimplicial-identities.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
